1
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:15,000
Thou ancient, Thou free, Thou mountainous north.

2
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:22,000
Thou quiet, thou joyful, fair!

3
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:30,500
I greet you, most beautiful land upon earth,

4
00:00:30,500 --> 00:00:38,000
Your sun, your sky, your green meadows...

5
00:00:38,500 --> 00:00:46,500
Your sun, your sky, your green meadows!

6
00:00:46,500 --> 00:00:54,000
You are enthroned upon memories of great olden days,

7
00:00:54,000 --> 00:01:01,000
When honored your name flew across the earth,

8
00:01:01,000 --> 00:01:08,000
I know that you are and will remain what you were,

9
00:01:09,000 --> 00:01:17,000
Yes, I want to live, I want to die in the North...

10
00:01:17,000 --> 00:01:26,500
Yes, I want to live, I want to die in the North!